"""Human assessments from the complete bodies emitted in the read ledger."""
import json,pathlib
p=pathlib.Path(__file__).with_name('additional_pfp_application_remaining_notes.json');n=json.loads(p.read_text())
rows={
122:('Missing-input clarification is checked against an explicit host-selected requirements tuple and supplied JSON values. Exact seed equality, ordered missing fields, questions shape, bounded depth and finite values are checked; false and zero remain valid supplied premises. Hashes bind seed and requirements; output explicitly NOT_SOLVED.','Question wording is not checked for relevance or sufficiency; declared task premises are not inferred or justified.'),
124:('Full curriculum package export read; imports LadderController only.','No separate mathematics or runtime proof.'),
125:('Full ladder controller read. Digest string is checked before each trial, but no checker evaluates a candidate: success is bool(proposer(...)). Any truthy object counts; constructor lacks trial/threshold/axis validation. Thus certified benchmark wording overstates this callback aggregator and empty axes can yield all_passed.','A proposer may be an already independently graded callback by external convention, but that contract is not enforced here; digest fixity is not judge adequacy.'),
135:('Full documentation-integrity service read. Forwards request plus injected clock time to gateway without changing result.','Gateway custody and command safety are delegated, not proved by this service.'),
136:('Full certified-ladder use case including 13 public P0 controls read. Repeats the same gate twice and compares status; expected scalar is fixed at 3 even for a custom item bank. P0 pass requires rejected negatives and matching positive expectations, not every negative expected refusal reason. evaluate_hypotheses substitutes favorable accuracy/cost/gain/zero-failure defaults when empirical fields are absent.','Two identical passes are replay agreement, not independent judges. Default metric values are synthetic assumptions and cannot support empirical hypotheses. Host gates and hypothesis predicates belong to domain review.'),
137:('Full adversary-gate use case read. Injected tribunal result is returned; pilot conversion carries target/status/checker/prompt or caller receipt. gate_id argument is unused and an existing mismatching demo_id is retained.','No caller-level receipt-binding or gate-selection enforcement. Actual adapter may validate; no fresh evaluation performed.'),
138:('Full pilot evaluator read. Revalidates typed response binding, audits prompt, parses actual raw reply and invokes fixed host checker against pilot expected_answer. Missing candidate yields NOT_RUN, malformed reply fails, accepted result transitions pilot state. Injected storage/gate_evaluator/runner are unused by this path.','Acceptance depends on host reference and checker adequacy, not a derivation from prompt; older observation/receipt fallback remains separate from typed raw-byte branch.'),
139:('Full pilot-suite orchestration read. Validates finite case/call/token/cost caps, explicit model/provider preflight, new output directory and noncolliding portable response names. Dry-run uses host answer and labels self-consistency distinctly. Unknown costs stay nullable; ratios require completed unique plain/template pairs. Objective hash binds model/checker/messages but not expected answer, raw source bytes or resource bounds; grading uses one seed answer for all supplied specs.','No execution/provider calls. Port owns durable reservation and dispatch; post-preflight dispatch/grade/write exceptions escape the Result boundary. Correctness ratios are conditional on eligible replies and accompanied by malformed counts; not total-task accuracy or causal evidence.'),
140:('Full numbered-stage execution adapter read. Catalog and exact typed host Stage5 response required; model JSON rejects duplicate/nonfinite tokens, strict integer schemas and cross-stage candidate references. Pilot answer acceptance remains NOT_RUN after pipeline completion. Replay return matches demo/stage/count/candidate labels/expected flags, but caller does not compare witness bytes; actual witness checking depends on verifier. Provider is called directly without this layer reserving money/tool budgets.','Mode receipts and host verdict are injected trust boundaries. Schema validation occurs after dispatch; external schema retrieval is not locally disabled in this adapter. Candidate semantics and ledger persistence are not supplied by AuthorityEffect=None.'),
148:('Full proposal-checking owner read. Strict common envelope, native Boolean normalization, deep copies per judge and disagreement/exception distinctions prevent obvious self-grading. Repair text comes from bounded host dictionary. Task-turn schema regenerated from task and attempt constant, binding schema/input identities before judging. Schema reference graph prohibits external refs and same-instance cycles, integer type is exact Python int.','Judges are injected; agreement does not establish independence/adequacy. Task answer is TASK_CHECKED even on rejection, whereas no checker leaves UNVERIFIED. No provider calls or new mathematical solution.'),
149:('Full two-attempt policy and numbered pipeline controller read. Max two stages enforced exactly; only whitelisted feedback allows repair. Reservation and request precede dispatch; transport/accounting failures retain holds and stop. Host stage separation, dependencies, acceptance-stage coverage and recomputed receipt terminal constrain positive completion.','Port owns accounting durability and real limits; exceptions in record_request/record_raw/observe lie outside guarded failure handling. Finite retry bound is not convergence or provider-effectiveness evidence; all_stages_passed may coexist with VERIFIED_WITH_RESIDUALS.'),
159:('Full scoring owner read. Legacy EvaluateCoboundaryScoreUseCase counts claimed IDs against a bare total and marks exact when count saturates plus reference presence; neither open-ID membership nor witness checked. Float diagnostics accept some nonfinite inputs and measure declared masses. Canonical score_discrete/cochain and rank operations delegate to Rust port with exact rational normalization and explicit policy; these are different paths.','Cardinality score is not Phi1, physical fidelity, or semantic truth. Cost/obstruction declarations and detector vocabulary remain admitted; finite arithmetic and ranking cannot establish source adequacy.'),
}
for i,(assessment,limits)in rows.items():n[str(i)]={'assessment':assessment,'limits':limits}
p.write_text(json.dumps(n,indent=2)+'\n')
